{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When two incomplete souls come together, a new legend begins.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guy, a blacksmith who lost his wife, daughter, and one arm in a witch hunt.<br>And Sophie, a female blacksmith cast out of the trade simply because \u201ciron struck by a woman is cursed.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fill each other\u2019s voids, the two gather under one roof and reignite the forge\u2019s flame.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/be15290921da7e3e8b5a122bf9d94954.poster.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/be15290921da7e3e8b5a122bf9d94954.webm?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/be15290921da7e3e8b5a122bf9d94954.mp4?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/a1b8796c1c0f42048b0c0e69fd59fd23.poster.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/a1b8796c1c0f42048b0c0e69fd59fd23.webm?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/a1b8796c1c0f42048b0c0e69fd59fd23.mp4?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the iron they forge become tools that help people, or weapons filled with fury against the world?<strong>    </strong><br><br><br><strong>Your choices will decide the fate of this forge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Experiences</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/adeb7a36a0d71f265d4ebbb01245acbf.avif?t=1772469135\" width=540 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/37ce2984aee9eafcc09bb12ffa54fde8.poster.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/37ce2984aee9eafcc09bb12ffa54fde8.webm?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/37ce2984aee9eafcc09bb12ffa54fde8.mp4?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove impurities from metal ingots to obtain shiny ingots.<br><i>Sometimes, precious metals such as gold and silver may be hidden inside.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingots are the first choice for crafting weapons and the starting point for blacksmithing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/b0cb69d88d74b2e881989142bccaa523.avif?t=1772469135\" width=540 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/095ef388f03ea23174becb39ae48f14d.poster.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/095ef388f03ea23174becb39ae48f14d.webm?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/095ef388f03ea23174becb39ae48f14d.mp4?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble puzzle pieces on blueprints to craft your own unique weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/6440f5beecfe1c48898a5ca1b01023a6.poster.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/6440f5beecfe1c48898a5ca1b01023a6.webm?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/6440f5beecfe1c48898a5ca1b01023a6.mp4?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special abilities of blocks</strong> and <strong>placement methods</strong> grant various bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stats of your weapons will vary depending on how you complete the puzzle with different block combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, even if you create the same weapon, you can make completely different weapons depending on which pieces you choose and how you place them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use creative combinations and strategic decisions to craft <strong>your own unique creations</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/aa331a90663c6db60246a5387248db9f.avif?t=1772469135\" width=540 height=90 /></span><i> </i>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/0ef7af6b7066f7c54f539696e09c7a74.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1560 height=958 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Make and sell weapons to meet the demands of customers who visit your blacksmith shop! <br><i>Sometimes, customers with bad intentions will show up.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet various people while running a blacksmith shop, upgrade your shop, and advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/4ed76b4edc6e0a32e0aeab7d08254a96.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase the necessary materials from merchants or obtain them from resources provided by woodcutters and miners. However, the materials you want are not always available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes you have to find them yourself through gathering or simple combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to craft and display, how to set prices, how to manage inventory...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your decisions will determine the reputation and profits of your blacksmith shop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> <strong>The flames of the forge reignite at your fingertips!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/addda92ad8307c6ee28b53bcfeca6aed.poster.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/addda92ad8307c6ee28b53bcfeca6aed.webm?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/addda92ad8307c6ee28b53bcfeca6aed.mp4?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tokatonton: One-Armed Blacksmith</i> is a story of two wounded craftsmen who embrace each other and face the world together, as well as an experience where players craft weapons and skills with their own hands, creating warmth and meaning within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What kind of legend would you like to create in this small smithy?</strong><br>Whether the steel hammered by two wounded smiths becomes a weapon that harms or gear that helps is up to your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3399610?t=1772469135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/7055938eee3d04c800c1e8bb656f93a31efa896a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772469135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/0b5f8d6f3efe63fce9a0cf05d0196fd10e38bf8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772469135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/0b5f8d6f3efe63fce9a0cf05d0196fd10e38bf8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772469135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When two incomplete souls come together, a new legend begins.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guy, a blacksmith who lost his wife, daughter, and one arm in a witch hunt.<br>And Sophie, a female blacksmith cast out of the trade simply because \u201ciron struck by a woman is cursed.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fill each other\u2019s voids, the two gather under one roof and reignite the forge\u2019s flame.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/be15290921da7e3e8b5a122bf9d94954.poster.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/be15290921da7e3e8b5a122bf9d94954.webm?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/be15290921da7e3e8b5a122bf9d94954.mp4?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/a1b8796c1c0f42048b0c0e69fd59fd23.poster.avif?t=1772469135\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/a1b8796c1c0f42048b0c0e69fd59fd23.webm?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399610/extras/a1b8796c1c0f42048b0c0e69fd59fd23.mp4?t=1772469135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the iron they forge become tools that help people, or weapons filled with fury against the world?<strong>    </strong><br><br><br><strong>Your choices will decide the fate of this forge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Experiences</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i